  "title": "Flourless Molten Spice Cake",
  "description": "Perfect for Valentine's Day, this cake recipe makes two individually-sized molten cakes that are rich and chocolaty with spicy hints of ginger.",
  "authors": [
    "Katering by Kreft"
  ],
